(862, 1, '2018-01-17 15:35:24', '2018-01-17 15:35:24', '[vc_row full_height=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1516717495125{padding-top: 20% !important;padding-bottom: 5% !important;}\"][vc_column][kentha-cover-carousel title=\"Release cover carousel\" quantity=\"12\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1516717520323{padding-top: 100px !important;padding-bottom: 100px !important;background-color: #000000 !important;}\"][vc_column][vc_row_inner qt_container=\"true\"][vc_column_inner][vc_column_text]\n<h4>Simple, fast, interactive</h4>\nEasily add a cover carousel to any page with Page Composer. This carousel displays 3 album per row for a maximum of 12 elements (performance-safe limit). Each album, if contains audio tracks, can be played directly clicking the Play button, or you can go to the single release page clicking the title.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row]', 'Release Cover Carousel', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'release-cover-carousel', '', '', '2018-01-17 15:35:24', '2018-01-17 15:35:24', '', 505, 'https://qantumthemes.xyz/kentha/demo1/?page_id=862', 0, 'page', '', 0),
(866, 1, '2018-01-17 15:42:01', '2018-01-17 15:42:01', '[vc_row full_height=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1516717257733{padding-top: 20% !important;padding-bottom: 15% !important;}\"][vc_column][kentha-releases-large title=\"Featured album\" quantity=\"6\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1516717392207{padding-top: 100px !important;padding-bottom: 100px !important;background-color: #000000 !important;}\"][vc_column][vc_row_inner qt_container=\"true\" css=\".vc_custom_1516717320676{background-color: #000000 !important;}\"][vc_column_inner css=\".vc_custom_1516717366954{padding-top: 0px !important;padding-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1516717325909{padding-top: 0px !important;padding-bottom: 0px !important;}\"]\n<h4>Display featured album in a super interactive carousel</h4>\nThis drag and drop element displays a featured album release carusel including album introduction, cover and tracklist. you can play the tracks directly or go to the single album page. To add it, is just required to choose the element from the page Composer and place it in your page. You can then choose the amount of album to display and other query parameters.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row]', 'Release featured', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'release-featured', '', '', '2018-01-17 15:42:01', '2018-01-17 15:42:01', '', 505, 'https://qantumthemes.xyz/kentha/demo1/?page_id=866', 0, 'page', '', 0),
(873, 1, '2018-01-17 16:01:48', '2018-01-17 16:01:48', '[vc_row full_height=\"yes\"][vc_column][kentha-perspectivecard text=\"START BLASTING!\" background1=\"1239\" background2=\"1240\" background3=\"1241\" background4=\"1242\" foreground1=\"1243\" foreground2=\"493\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1516717574203{padding-top: 100px !important;padding-bottom: 100px !important;background-color: #000000 !important;}\"][vc_column][vc_row_inner qt_container=\"true\"][vc_column_inner width=\"1/2\"][vc_column_text]\n<h1>Seduce your visitors</h1>\n<h4>3D album is here!</h4>\n<ul>\n 	<li>No complex setup procedures</li>\n 	<li>Drag and drop method</li>\n 	<li>Easily upload up to 6 design levels</li>\n 	<li>Choose any release by ID or display the latest one</li>\n</ul>\nWith this innovative and responsive 3d element you can add to your site the WOW effect it needs,<strong> without any heavy extra plugin!</strong>\n\nYou can also choose which action to link on the click, it can send the visitor to the album or play the album straight away![/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/2\" css=\".vc_custom_1516716390351{padding-top: 80px !important;}\"][kentha-shortimage target=\"_self\" image=\"1380\"][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row]', '3D Album', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', '3d-album', '', '', '2018-01-17 16:01:48', '2018-01-17 16:01:48', '', 505, 'https://qantumthemes.xyz/kentha/demo1/release-cover-carousel-2/', 0, 'page', '', 0),
(890, 1, '2018-01-17 16:26:47', '2018-01-17 16:26:47', '[vc_row qt_container=\"true\" css=\".vc_custom_1517404240060{padding-top: 23% !important;padding-bottom: 5% !important;}\"][vc_column][kentha-releases-small cols=\"4\" size=\"medium\" title=\"Release grid - variable columns\" quantity=\"3\"][kentha-releases-small cols=\"3\" size=\"medium\" title=\"\" quantity=\"4\"][kentha-releases-small size=\"medium\" title=\"\"][vc_row_inner css=\".vc_custom_1516206088044{padding-top: 3% !important;}\"][vc_column_inner width=\"1/2\"][vc_column_text]\n<h4>Endless possibilities for your music</h4>\nThis element can display your album releases in a variable number of columns (1 to 6) and you can choose the size of the thumbnails to fit larger designs.\n\nThe query can be adjusted by category, number, offset or also extract by id list.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/2\"][kentha-releases-small orderby=\"rand\" cols=\"3\" size=\"medium\" title=\"\" quantity=\"8\" offset=\"6\"][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row]', 'Releases grid', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'releases-grid', '', '', '2018-01-17 16:26:47', '2018-01-17 16:26:47', '', 505, 'https://qantumthemes.xyz/kentha/demo1/?page_id=890', 0, 'page', '', 0),
